Suddenly, a loud noise comes.
"Woof!"
"Woof!"
A dog jumps in front of the screen.
Who is this?
She is Lola!
Lola is our dog.
I laugh a lot.
"Hey Lola!" I say happily.
Lola looks at the screen.
She barks again.
"How are you, Lola?" I ask.
"You are my good pup," I say lovingly.
Diego laughs.
"Lola is your dog, Maya," Diego says.
"She looks for you," he says.
Her face is very sweet.
I love my Lola very much.
